{"version":1,"key":"article:86","content":{"id":86,"title":"Blob","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ab569076-d5a2-455d-ba5c-33e46df0c617","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"前端开发中经常需要和二进制数据打交道，用户选了一张图片要立即预览、录制一段音频要拼接成完整文件、从 Canvas 导出一张截图要触发下载。这些场景有一个共同点，就是需要在浏览器中表示和操作一段原始的二进制数据。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91ebcb7d-cb6a-473f-b186-397fd9d542ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Blob（Binary Large Object）就是浏览器为此提供的封装，它把一段不可变的二进制数据包装成一个对象，让你可以对它做切片、读取、生成链接、下载和上传等操作，而不用关心底层的字节细节。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"3a8b5788-195f-41fc-b52f-de04369e1a03","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"创建 Blob"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8511ce06-c07c-444a-99c0-0971430c4d97","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过构造函数创建一个 Blob 对象，其语法如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"a41486ea-e13b-4c51-a3c7-e689247557cf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5c109c3e-8e0e-413d-b608-6632a0946e32","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const blob = new Blob(blobParts, options)","collabId":"d8028c03-0e30-4e91-8a8e-aec94da287b1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"84e67412-9553-4080-a6ae-e5e256226899","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e80b0ea2-ddc1-415c-a69d-ed1dbac0ca70","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"77682453-d993-49a8-8c3a-04b413ed6773","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blobParts"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，一个可迭代的对象，其中的元素可以是"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"57532d8c-55ba-416d-bb0e-fee3d8fc1691","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"66961699-981c-42ef-9586-d08914031b21","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a0ab58d7-7650-463b-a761-6596d8ee2d82","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ArrayBuffer"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"be41aec8-75c5-4776-885b-dc78d3868f2f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"63b55682-70ef-4694-9812-bc9e4c259905","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"TypedArray"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9a7d67f2-cbd9-4cad-bd8b-b3948dadf1c8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"856496b7-606b-4c7e-9b36-78670f1fe5b4","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"DataView"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b5af33e6-2917-46c8-89f0-5f0e7dfef323","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"348e35dc-7109-4fba-bb2c-858936323875","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Blob"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1c3b1f2f-76fc-44c0-bd9e-838ea5a05c63","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9b0559b2-d93b-40ff-b04e-6743906fbb3e","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"string"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"72ab26d1-f70c-458d-94ce-4c913b989dcf","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"057678d5-c42f-46d3-91e4-7cb8ecc69068","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"options"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可选选项，有两个选项可以设置"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e0477dd5-c7a4-4768-a631-5cca514afbf5","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"37addb8b-207f-4beb-8eab-0ea2a6024f6f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"88c574bd-6246-40e5-bb43-330fbe6738b4","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：数据的 MIME 类型，默认值是一个空字符串"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"65875a50-32d7-4994-a865-9f568566441e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f0c6133b-88a1-42f7-962b-44b9858eda87","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"endings"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：当数据是文本时，该选项决定如何处理内容中的换行符 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"\\n"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。默认值是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"transparent"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即不进行任何改变；如果需要将换行符转化为主机系统的约定，将值指定为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"native"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"192931f4-294c-4aba-810f-91f6201cca22","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"42fec6bd-0b7e-4127-97f5-9b9b0293bf1e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 1. 从字符串创建\nconst textBlob = new Blob([\"Hello, World!\"], { type: \"text/plain\" })\n\n// 2. 从 JSON 创建\nconst jsonBlob = new Blob(\n  [JSON.stringify({ name: \"test\", value: 42 })],\n  { type: \"application/json\" }\n)\n\n// 3. 从 TypedArray 创建\nconst bytes = new Uint8Array([72, 101, 108, 108, 111])\nconst bufferBlob = new Blob([bytes], { type: \"application/octet-stream\" })\n\n// 4. 从 ArrayBuffer 创建\nconst buffer = new ArrayBuffer(8)\nconst abBlob = new Blob([buffer])\n\n// 5. 拼接多个 Blob\nconst part1 = new Blob([\"Part 1, \"])\nconst part2 = new Blob([\"Part 2\"])\nconst combined = new Blob([part1, part2], { type: \"text/plain\" })\n\n// 6. 混合数据源\nconst mixed = new Blob(\n  [\"header\\n\", new Uint8Array([0x00, 0x01]), anotherBlob],\n  { type: \"application/octet-stream\" }\n)","collabId":"72ee3e0d-8a85-48d6-a891-c4f49d63758f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d251f7ab-bb7f-4725-9cec-83f6fd357aee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Blob 对象一旦创建就不能被修改，如果想修改，只能基于原有数据创建新的 Blob。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"ab741459-f0de-446b-8977-dddd6661f4b4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"属性与方法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c707999b-8a23-40cb-8f88-3a8325cf8a3e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Blob 实例有两个只读属性："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"16c73c18-36a8-44a7-b042-5a5d0f0def16","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0cdc848a-40ac-447e-88e3-93df3045f6f6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"837d2c8a-796a-4078-8263-afb52d54480a","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"size"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：字节大小"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ea76055b-8d12-483e-89d5-95f1fc69d9f6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"177ebe2a-a398-4927-86c2-6a9c03e1c43f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：构建时传入的 MIME 类型"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f443d8b-71aa-4ca7-8727-ae29d8f42eb5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Blob 实例上还提供了一组方法，用于以不同方式读取内部的二进制数据："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"d45ea496-78f1-44f8-986b-91ec3a162f8a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"77d65c52-1010-4825-b1e2-1db333b09c36","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"512365c3-03a5-49d2-b914-1d0d7ae07f97","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"text()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：将 Blob 内容读取为 UTF-8 字符串（返回 Promise）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"adf67453-eb05-4b73-9f27-1191366d6ed7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ce903798-f794-4c1d-add7-32d2f7c18442","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arrayBuffer()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：将 Blob 内容读取为 ArrayBuffer（返回 Promise）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d8b5102f-4763-4f56-a23c-409d09764440","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3ebd8d9c-2d5a-41ad-8f49-bd2e87160a44","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"bytes()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：将 Blob 数据读取为 Uint8Array（返回 Promise）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d33d028e-7410-452b-a06a-28da8836315a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7e4f931b-e01b-449b-b0cc-7595f7d613e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"stream()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：返回一个 ReadableStream 对象，可流式读取 Blob 内容"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"634bbf65-eae2-4e6b-a4bb-675f4047f600","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b80fb99b-ad73-4c7b-b874-ae6259c16745","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"slice()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：根据指定的字节范围，返回一个新的 Blob"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b967b947-d59a-482d-b520-5e81bc98854a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ed508fa9-7f04-4802-b63c-c66f01ca431d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 1. text() —— 将 Blob 内容读取为 UTF-8 字符串（返回 Promise）\nconst text = await blob.text()\n\n// 2. arrayBuffer() —— 将 Blob 内容读取为 ArrayBuffer（返回 Promise）\nconst buffer = await blob.arrayBuffer()\n\n// 3. bytes() —— 将 Blob 内容读取为 Uint8Array（较新的 API）\nconst uint8 = await blob.bytes()\n\n// 4. stream() —— 返回一个 ReadableStream，可以流式消费数据\nconst readableStream = blob.stream()\nconst reader = readableStream.getReader()\nwhile (true) {\n  const { done, value } = await reader.read()\n  if (done) break\n  console.log(value) // Uint8Array 片段\n}\n\n// 5. slice() —— 截取 Blob 的一部分，返回新的 Blob\nconst sliced = blob.slice(0, 3, \"text/plain\")\n// 类似数组的 slice，参数为 (start, end, contentType)\n// 常用于大文件分片上传","collabId":"af7eac07-7ceb-4b2e-8723-a1d58735a9e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"d41a3d1c-d8ae-4c08-b5bf-abaec8786db5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用场景"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"65ca675e-e86a-457e-af9c-e058acc9c80c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下来我们看一下如何通过 Blob 的实例方法以及 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"URL.createObjectURL"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来处理二进制文件的数据传输，数据预览，流式处理等实际应用场景。"}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"blue","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"ce455251-b6b9-47c8-ac39-73c4ee74c163","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2ab4347b-2bc8-44a6-a422-e929589d1501","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"URL.createObjectURL(blob)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 接收一个 Blob 对象，返回一个以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob:"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开头的临时 URL。这个 URL 的生命周期与当前文档绑定，浏览器内部维护了一个从该 URL 到 Blob 数据的引用映射，因此可以像普通 URL 一样赋给 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<img src>"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<a href>"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<video src>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Worker()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 构造函数等。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9f02bd16-1eea-4597-a2e4-9f28bb600dbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用完毕后应调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"URL.revokeObjectURL(url)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 手动释放引用，避免内存泄漏。"}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"899bcfce-92ab-49dc-b6e4-f508e1bb83ed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"分片上传"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"be2728cf-21f0-4882-b131-590c135cf7ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"利用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"slice()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法将大 Blob 拆分为多个小片段逐一上传，配合服务端返回的已上传偏移量，还可以实现断点续传。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"d13a57a0-430c-413e-80dc-f6cd91bf17b8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6db3211c-899f-407c-bf0b-fb7db18878df","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const CHUNK_SIZE = 5 * 1024 * 1024 // 5MB 一片\n\nasync function uploadBlob(blob, filename) {\n  const totalChunks = Math.ceil(blob.size / CHUNK_SIZE)\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < totalChunks; i++) {\n    const start = i * CHUNK_SIZE\n    const end = Math.min(start + CHUNK_SIZE, blob.size)\n    const chunk = blob.slice(start, end) // 截取当前分片\n\n    const formData = new FormData()\n    formData.append(\"file\", chunk)\n    formData.append(\"index\", i)\n    formData.append(\"total\", totalChunks)\n\n    await fetch(\"/api/upload-chunk\", { method: \"POST\", body: formData })\n  }\n}","collabId":"c35dfb2e-635e-4200-a6f7-c73b737f4d1c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"7339b3eb-de11-4665-babd-65fb078f27d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文件下载"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c247c571-3ed1-48a0-8fce-8b14f20c8a91","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过代码生成数据（JSON、CSV 等），利用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"URL.createObjectURL"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 Blob 创建一个临时的 URL，然后触发浏览器下载。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"013f549f-7e39-4414-821e-911c9ec36821","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8dc67658-9738-4d04-befb-afc602e639c9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function downloadBlob(blob, filename) {\n  const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob)\n  const a = document.createElement(\"a\")\n  a.href = url\n  a.download = filename\n  a.click()\n  // 使用完毕后需要调用 URL.revokeObjectURL(url) 释放内存引用\n  URL.revokeObjectURL(url)\n}\n\n// 下载 JSON\nconst json = JSON.stringify({ name: \"test\", data: [1, 2, 3] }, null, 2)\ndownloadBlob(new Blob([json], { type: \"application/json\" }), \"data.json\")\n\n// 下载 CSV\nconst csv = \"name,age\\nAlice,30\\nBob,25\"\ndownloadBlob(new Blob([csv], { type: \"text/csv\" }), \"users.csv\")","collabId":"559ec1e3-ce9d-43d9-95b0-9530b8d34fa2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"155d10e7-187c-44d9-a9f9-4e15c7fbaa19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Canvas 图片导出"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5cb08dc7-6da4-454a-a882-d94b300424ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"canvas.toBlob()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以将画布内容导出为 Blob，配合 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"URL.createObjectURL"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 即可实现下载。"},{"type":"content-link","refId":755,"contentId":6029,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"f07a5484-5a12-4469-95aa-da36b9de4c57","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"OffscreenCanvas"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也提供了对应的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"convertToBlob()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，可以获取到离屏画布的内容。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"23de34b1-28c6-4756-94c3-dcd49da5f530","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"756d527c-1931-42a7-8637-81c46ea51fe1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// canvas.toBlob —— 回调方式\ncanvas.toBlob((blob) => {\n  const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob)\n  const a = document.createElement(\"a\")\n  a.href = url\n  a.download = \"canvas-export.png\"\n  a.click()\n  URL.revokeObjectURL(url)\n}, \"image/png\")\n\n// offscreenCanvas.convertToBlob —— Promise 方式（可在 Worker 中使用）\nconst offscreen = new OffscreenCanvas(200, 200)\nconst offCtx = offscreen.getContext(\"2d\")\noffCtx.fillStyle = \"blue\"\noffCtx.fillRect(0, 0, 200, 200)\n\nconst blob = await offscreen.convertToBlob({\n  type: \"image/webp\",\n  quality: 0.8,\n})","collabId":"d109d55b-add3-4b2e-b372-d9c8a6a2aba5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"7a8bffb0-88a6-4e34-8e06-fa4a427419a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"流式处理大文件"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8d73fcb2-6911-43c0-b659-8051930de8f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"stream()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ReadableStream"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以逐块消费数据而不需要将整个文件读入内存。无论文件多大，内存中始终只保留当前正在处理的那一小块。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e45aaaa1-cc66-4c50-8d7d-57ecef521b19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面演示对大文件做流式字节频率统计，统计文件中每种字节值（0–255）出现了多少次："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"81f15d23-e8a0-4aba-bebb-904f130411d5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"24d1b206-1115-4c00-b996-c816df6717c8","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"async function countByteFrequency(file) {\n  const reader = file.stream().getReader()\n  const frequency = new Uint32Array(256) // 256 种字节值，内存恒定 1KB\n\n  while (true) {\n    const { done, value } = await reader.read()\n    if (done) break\n    // 逐块处理，不累积历史数据\n    for (let i = 0; i < value.length; i++) {\n      frequency[value[i]]++\n    }\n  }\n\n  return frequency\n}","collabId":"6c1137b1-07ab-4fb6-a766-838091834e04","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"642c1dad-ff31-40bb-8f17-a2330f8a5109","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个例子真正做到了「逐块处理、内存占用恒定」，不管文件是 10MB 还是 10GB，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"frequency"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组的大小始终是 1KB。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"b36faaaa-496a-41de-9c67-44213dfe400e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图片预览"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e8ff1849-d97a-46cc-b010-c54253306a3e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用户选择文件后，立即生成预览地址，无需先上传到服务器。这里的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"File"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象继承自 Blob，所以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"URL.createObjectURL"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以直接接收它："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b58eda64-5347-450d-9180-4bab30384a88","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ec3b0dfe-ab3e-4caa-9155-51801388ef7f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const input = document.querySelector('input[type=\"file\"]')\ninput.addEventListener(\"change\", (e) => {\n  const file = e.target.files[0] // File 继承自 Blob\n  const url = URL.createObjectURL(file)\n\n  const img = document.createElement(\"img\")\n  img.src = url\n  img.onload = () => URL.revokeObjectURL(url) // 图片加载完即可释放\n  document.body.appendChild(img)\n})","collabId":"ebe3ce68-2b93-4980-82f3-ef7d454104b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"79445883-1cce-40d0-b288-d991700023d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"音视频录制"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0c90c1a8-acd8-45d8-ad4f-1f1d16779840","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 MediaRecorder 录制音视频时，每次 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ondataavailable"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件触发时，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"event.data"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是一个 Blob 片段。录制结束后将所有片段合并，即可得到完整的音视频文件："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6249e425-933a-47b2-a15d-aae791389dd8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"969d7a3e-b1f8-497b-b3af-4c680bdf453d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ audio: true, video: true })\nconst recorder = new MediaRecorder(stream, { mimeType: \"video/webm\" })\n\nconst chunks = []\nrecorder.ondataavailable = (event) => {\n  if (event.data.size > 0) {\n    chunks.push(event.data) // event.data 就是 Blob\n  }\n}\n\nrecorder.onstop = () => {\n  // 将所有片段合并为一个完整的 Blob，后续可用于下载或上传\n  const fullBlob = new Blob(chunks, { type: \"video/webm\" })\n  const url = URL.createObjectURL(fullBlob)\n  videoElement.src = url\n}\n\nrecorder.start(1000) // 每 1000ms 触发一次 ondataavailable\nsetTimeout(() => recorder.stop(), 5000) // 录制 5 秒","collabId":"326b5203-b790-4115-8e27-24b8a77be8c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"2c8a5e05-0ac0-4fe1-93b6-82a895511717","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"动态 Worker 脚本"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b4584d3c-9f6e-496f-8fb6-bb5519bf6158","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 Blob 动态生成代码并作为 Worker 执行，无需额外的脚本文件："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"7565ae65-31d7-4300-8bac-e0a44366d3f0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6e0d5feb-7622-47c7-9e20-1dc0d02ca910","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const workerCode = `\n  self.onmessage = (e) => {\n    const result = e.data.numbers.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0)\n    self.postMessage({ sum: result })\n  }\n`\nconst blob = new Blob([workerCode], { type: \"application/javascript\" })\nconst worker = new Worker(URL.createObjectURL(blob))\n\nworker.onmessage = (e) => console.log(\"计算结果:\", e.data.sum)\nworker.postMessage({ numbers: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5] })","collabId":"c8390ea2-b567-4e53-b762-16f0f5abd6ee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5bb8cf4b-06ec-4453-9572-c8f018d760e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS Paint Worklet 同理，可以动态注册自定义绘制逻辑："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"14ee5c6d-feee-4626-b712-8fd9ee0276c3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e3ec6797-2291-4d24-9d8c-527a2ec7dc3c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const paintCode = `\n  registerPaint('checkerboard', class {\n    paint(ctx, size) {\n      const cell = 20\n      for (let y = 0; y < size.height; y += cell) {\n        for (let x = 0; x < size.width; x += cell) {\n          if ((x / cell + y / cell) % 2 === 0) {\n            ctx.fillStyle = '#eee'\n            ctx.fillRect(x, y, cell, cell)\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  })\n`\nconst blob = new Blob([paintCode], { type: \"application/javascript\" })\nCSS.paintWorklet.addModule(URL.createObjectURL(blob))\n// 之后在 CSS 中使用: background: paint(checkerboard)","collabId":"ffeafbef-cae9-4f29-bac4-6f172bb31289","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"bbe7f49f-de87-44ea-b7e6-7fc0100a43a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Blob 与相关对象的关系"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1df4f71f-96a6-4d11-a442-5656412d1558","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 Blob 的过程中会频繁接触到 ArrayBuffer、TypedArray、File 等概念，它们各自的定位不同："}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/openai-image-1-1781530350867_9c9efc76-869a-41a2-9e8e-7e3034b114b3.webp","alt":"Blob 与相关对象的关系","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/openai-image-1-1781530350867_9c9efc76-869a-41a2-9e8e-7e3034b114b3.webp","width":531,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f1786f3e-93f0-4b7d-8916-0ddd9e3bcd4d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"4486bd3f-6ac4-4c74-a2b3-fabd039f0e35","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e93698f4-0572-405c-b644-b42d15ec1ede","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4f82f1df-3cb1-43b5-9728-908a67ee8d53","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​ArrayBuffer 是一块可以按字节读写的内存，适合做底层的数据操作（比如解析二进制协议）。它是可变的，但长度固定。TypedArray 和 DataView 是它的读写视图。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a800f7ab-caab-49b6-a202-c24f0f1172df","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"da2bb32f-f5f4-45f2-ad52-4fed294fd657","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​Blob 是一个不可变的数据容器，适合做数据的传输和存储（比如上传文件、生成下载链接）。不能直接修改 Blob 的内容，但可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arrayBuffer()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法将其转为 ArrayBuffer 来读取原始字节。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d84d2d08-4d99-4229-aeb6-f2fdd8373770","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"69b58bcb-c10d-414f-873d-5acd102210b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"​File 继承自 Blob，多了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"name"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（文件名）和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"lastModified"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（最后修改时间）两个属性。通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<input type=\"file\">"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选择的文件、拖拽上传的文件，拿到的都是 File 对象，它可以直接用在所有接收 Blob 的地方。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"16c9bf20-9ebc-49e6-a93d-945d83a05bd6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它们之间可以互相转换："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"649df530-ae45-4033-81cc-fa5f9aaec4ca","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"94a12d00-731f-4041-9728-d688d9e8e8f2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// ArrayBuffer → Blob\nconst buffer = new ArrayBuffer(8)\nconst blob = new Blob([buffer], { type: \"application/octet-stream\" })\n\n// Blob → ArrayBuffer\nconst ab = await blob.arrayBuffer()\n\n// Blob → Uint8Array\nconst bytes = await blob.bytes()\n// 或者从 ArrayBuffer 构造\nconst bytes2 = new Uint8Array(await blob.arrayBuffer())\n\n// Uint8Array → Blob\nconst blob2 = new Blob([bytes], { type: \"application/octet-stream\" })\n\n// Blob → File（手动补充文件名和修改时间）\nconst file = new File([blob], \"example.bin\", {\n  type: blob.type,\n  lastModified: Date.now(),\n})\n\n// File → Blob（File 本身就是 Blob，无需转换，直接当 Blob 用）\nconst size = file.size       // Blob 的属性\nconst chunk = file.slice(0, 1024)  // Blob 的方法","collabId":"11697859-bb8d-45ac-b6a5-4a55920b319e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C%3A%5CUsers%5Cpc%5CDesktop%5Cimages%5Cwallhaven-ner9wk_96b5ba3f-2471-4976-ba50-7ce45248960f.webp","createTime":1781273850715,"updateTime":1781532254206},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1781532254206},"links":{"card:755":{"key":"card:755","type":"card","id":755}}}